Vnum            12712
Name            裂魄寂界座~
Description
寂界座像整段寂界井腹最後一塊仍勉強聚得住輪廓的寂魄石座，腳下環界只剩一圈隨時會再淡盡一層的細薄紋，所有殘痕都在這裡被拖往更深的裂魄寥界。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        12711
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        12801
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         寂界座~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深處~
End

End
